  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271860</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>見る？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wanna see?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271900</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>は？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>271952</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>見る？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wanna see?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272000</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>え、えっと～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh, umm...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272092</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>見るか？　って聞いてんだよ。
ハッキリしろよなぁ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm asking if you wanna see.
C'mon, I need an answer.
Make yourselves clear already.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272176</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ごめん、言ってる意味が、
ボクたちにはわからないシ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sorry, we just don't really know
what you mean by that...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272256</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぐだぐだうるせー。
サッサと見れ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Holy wow, you guys talk too
much. Just shut up and look!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272400</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;が、ここにいるのに、
あっちにも&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;が出てきて、
&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;になったど？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;'s here, but a &lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt; showed
up over there, too. So, what, does
that make &lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272480</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さっきのって、
ボクたちが
喋ってたことだよね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wasn't that all stuff we've
said to each other before?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272536</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん、わたし覚えてるよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah, I remember it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272660</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やっとわかったか、
オイラの偉大さが！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Now you finally see
how magnificent I am!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272660</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>その名も
『チャットプレイヤー・クロス』！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's called the "Skit Player: Cross"!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272752</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これって、俺たちの会話が、
いつでも見られるってことか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So with this, we can see
all the conversations we've
had, whenever we want?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272920</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>飲み込みの早いヤツは、
嫌いじゃないぜ～。
つまりは、そういうこと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I do like the ones who
catch on quick~. Yeah,
that's the short version.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>272920</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いつでも、
幾らでも見せてやるからよ、
また遊びに来いよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You can watch them whenever
you like, as much as you like!
So do come again!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273016</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ありがとうございます。
それじゃ、遠慮なく、
また見に来ますね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thank you very much.
Then, we will come back
and watch sometime.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273136</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;が、
違うの見だら、さらに
&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;が増えて～の……∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If &lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt; watches
another 'un, we'll get
even more &lt;Mel&gt;&lt;Mel&gt;s~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273196</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こいつ、まだそんなこと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He's still going on about that...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
